.TH TIHO-PRIVATE 1 "November 2026" "Tiho Desktop" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tiho-private \- open a private Tiho browser window
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tiho-private
.RI [ Firefox options ] " " [ URL ... ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Opens a private window in the normal Tiho Firefox profile using Firefox's built-in private browsing mode.
Private browsing does not make the user anonymous and does not prevent websites, network providers or employers from observing network traffic.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tiho (1),
.BR tiho-bank (1)
